{"id": "388990", "name": "מציאת שני צרופים לינאריים זהים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "rand_mat2", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[0])],[0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[0])],[0,k]))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\"><p>הערת הקדמה: בהינתן שני זוגות וקטורים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_1,v_2\\)</span> ו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w_1,w_2\\)</span> ניתן לשאול האם יש צירוף לינארי לא טריוויאלי של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_1,v_2\\)</span> ששווה לצירוף לינארי לא טריוויאלי של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w_1,w_2\\)</span>, אך יש לשים לב שהדבר לא תמיד אפשרי. ייתכן כל צירוף לינארי לא טריוויאלי של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_1,v_2\\)</span> שונה מכל צירוף לינארי לא טריוויאלי של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w_1,w_2\\)</span>. למשל עבור</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(v_1={{CT:0}},v_2={{CT:1}}\\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(w_1={{CT:2}},w_2={{CT:3}}\\)</p><p>בנוסף, גם כאשר קיימים צירופים לינאריים כאלה, הם לא בהכרח יחידים. למשל עבור</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(v_1=w_1={{CT:0}},v_2=w_2={{CT:1}}\\)</p><p>מתקיים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(2v_1+\\frac{1}{2}v_2=v_1+v_2={{CT:4}}=w_1+w_2=2w_1+\\frac{1}{2}w_2\\)</p></div><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>כעת לשאלתנו:</p><p>נתונים שני זוגות וקטורים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(v_1 = {{CT:5}}, v_2={{CT:6}}\\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(u_1 = {{CT:7}}, u_2={{CT:8}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו סקלרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b,c,d\\)</span>, ווקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w\\)</span> <b>שונה מאפס</b> כך ש-</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(w=a v_1 + b v_2 = c u_1 + d u_2\\).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(a=\\) [[input:ans_a]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(b=\\) [[input:ans_b]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(c=\\) [[input:ans_c]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(d=\\) [[input:ans_d]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans_a]] [[validation:ans_b]] [[validation:ans_c]] [[validation:ans_d]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(w=\\) [[input:ans_vect]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans_vect]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans_a", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans_b", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans_c", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans_d", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans_vect", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([?],[?])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans_vect", "tans": "0 * ans_vect", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הוקטור שמצאת הוא וקטור האפס.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "mat1 . matrix([ans_a],[ans_b])", "tans": "ans_vect", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(w \\ne av_1 + b v_2\\).</p>תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "mat2 . matrix([ans_c],[ans_d])", "tans": "ans_vect", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה, יפה מאוד.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(w \\ne c u_1 + d u_2\\).</p>תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["mat1", "mat2", "nn", "ta_a", "ta_b", "ta_c", "ta_d", "ta_vect"], "nvariants": 50}